  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot or deep skillet over medium heat. Add the onion, bell pepper, and celery.",
    "Cook for 6 to 8 minutes, stirring often, until the vegetables are soft and the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the garlic, smoked paprika, thyme, and cayenne. Stir for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the kidney beans, rice, water, salt, black pepper, and bay leaves. Stir well and scrape up any bits from the bottom of the pot.",
    "Bring to a boil over high heat. Reduce to low and cover tightly.",
    "Simmer for 18 to 20 minutes without lifting the lid, until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed.",
    "Remove from the heat and let stand covered for 5 minutes. Discard the bay leaves.",
    "Mash a few beans against the side of the pot with a spoon to thicken it. Fluff with a fork and serve."
  ],
